{"name":"-54-B-4","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"356","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"At a safe house in Moscow."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_1","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After going through several buckets of concrete dissolver, Maggie finally manages to get Catherine out of the drum."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Sobs) My skin feels like sandpaper..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Be glad that you got out in one piece."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Couldn't you have gotten some better dissolver, you miser?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh. I bought it with your money though. I thought you'd appreciate my thriftiness."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh yeah, my money! Give it back!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? But you attached such a heartfelt message to the transfer. \"Farewell, my dear Maggie...\""}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"SHUT UP! I thought I was going to die back there!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_va_addingredient","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After pummeling Maggie for a bit, Catherine gives herself a healthy dose of machine oil."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_File_Put","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After that, she lounges in satisfaction on the sofa."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, so what's the job?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_21summer_avg_SecretAgent","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't know yet."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You accepted it without even knowing what it was?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's not going to be easy, that's for sure. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The client was willing to save us from the Vory just because we accepted the job."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I'm pretty sure our client isn't going to let us rip them off just like that. I get the feeling we'll have to pay it back soon enough."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Relax, we've always managed to make it onto Noah's Ark in the past. It won't be different this time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's true. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So, when do we start working on the job?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Right now."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ah... So how should we begin?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We'll know tomorrow. So far, our client has only given us a name for the job, \"Casino Royale\", and an anonymous call."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Click— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie replays that untraceable call."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"commsBox","raw":"通讯框"}],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Your interview will be at 9am tomorrow at the following coordinates.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It really is untraceable..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We haven't come up against someone like this in a long time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Anyone who can take care of the Vory that easily... is definitely no pushover... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Good grief, out of the frying pan and into the fire."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, it's more like driving a tiger to devour a wolf."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Still, we're not entirely without clues. Серый means \"gray\" in Russian."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gray... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I guess there must be some other meaning behind that word, so we need to peel it back, layer by layer... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Reminds me of old times, though the people we dealt with weren't nearly as troublesome as what we have on our hands right now."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"272","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Several days later, at the Flora Institute in Bremen."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Brain","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_footsteps_cave","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie arrives at a big building in the middle of the city, in keeping with the place and time on the invitation. She is guided to a waiting area by a receptionist."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Once the receptionist leaves, Maggie is left alone in the lavishly-decorated waiting lounge. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie notes that some of the signboards read \"Galatea\", but a further search proves inconclusive."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Maggie?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Open","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A door opens and a woman in a white uniform beckons at Maggie."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This way, please."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"412","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Led by the woman in white, Maggie enters an office and takes a seat on a cushy sofa."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The woman doesn't wait for Maggie to settle in before she begins."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's begin the interview, then."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Name."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie Ponzi."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Job."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Er... Social engineer."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_21Winter_Click_Keyboard","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The other person aloofly notes down Maggie's information."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In exchange, tell me who you are?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Client","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I am the client from \"Casino Royale\". "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I called you before, and now you must pass my test before I give you the assignment."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood. Let's begin, then."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Client","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The test has already started. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Maggie, use any means to convince me to hand the assignment to you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hm? ANY means?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Client","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Before I begin, please clarify one thing for me— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Only the client can decide if I'll get the assignment, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Client","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Correct."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So there's no way I can pass this test."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Client","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Why do you say that?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Because you're not the client."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Client","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you trying to gain the assignment by angering me? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How rude."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I have no intention of taking you lightly, Miss Leone."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Client","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It was easy enough to learn your true identity by analyzing your voiceprint and verifying it with your appearance. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Incidentally, the annual report you published for the Flora Institute last year was quite interesting. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, while this may cause some offense, I do not think you are qualified to be our mysterious client. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After all, our amazing client helped me resolve quite a sticky problem yesterday."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Client","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Judging by how you're hiding your name tag, did you think I read all this information off it? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That would show a tremendous lack of craft and it isn't in keeping with the tone of your company."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Leone","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Client","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Very well."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After recovering from her shock, Leone slowly leans back and the calm returns to her face."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In that case—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Applause","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Clap, clap, clap—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A round of applause reaches her ears, and the power within the room briefly cuts out. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"By the time Maggie acclimates to the darkness, Leone is gone. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In its place is a three-dimensional hologram that glows in the dark."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_22W_BGM_1","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Greetings, Miss Maggie.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mrs. \"Gray\", I presume?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Aren't you going to use the same trick on me?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Analyze my voiceprint and use my appearance to verify my identity?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nah. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I doubt it'll work on you anyway. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Or rather, the \"Mrs. Gray\" I'd find wouldn't be the real you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I like intelligent people who know their limits, Miss Maggie Ponzi.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Or should I say, Miss Maggie Ponzi's Doll assistant?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The finger Maggie is lightly tapping on the sofa freezes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't worry, your background is to your advantage.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"At first, I had my doubts about the deception skills of a Doll, but after learning you were one of the Dolls working for the Fox Sisterhood, I began looking forward to your performance.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I thought nobody remembered the Fox Sisterhood anymore."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humans have forgotten too many things that they should not have.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I heard they vanished after WWIII.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"To think I'd get to meet someone from that organization today.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No wonder you agreed to rescue Catherine so readily."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I have always been generous to people of worth.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So, what else is there, other than my background as part of the Fox Sisterhood? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What is it about us that you find worthwhile?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can always rest easy when speaking with intelligent people.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_footsteps_cave","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mrs. Gray rises slowly and steps away from the camera before returning shortly afterwards with a cup of coffee."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That would be the Project Tequila you're helming, or let's be frank here, would it be better to call it the Tequila Scam?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"page