an't help but sit up straight again."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"With the frequent outbreaks of wars, a well-known scientist hides behind the scenes, using the power of Relics to develop dirty bombs.\"","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The reason why Project Tequila is a scam is because none of that is true.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But I can make it come true.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie ponders Gray's words. Just the funds and resources needed to make that scam come true is enough to send a chill down her spine."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're going to such great lengths just to make a shell company legit?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Серый","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is only the beginning.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"From now on, there will be no Tequila Manufacturing, only a subsidiary of Galatea Corporation.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MrsGray","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}]